# Bank statement formats

Statement import is **CSV and XLSX** only (`date`, `amount`, `description`).

Do **not** add `.xls`, OFX, QIF, or live bank feeds unless a named bank/provider actually sends that format and the user asks to support that bank. Until then, extra parsers and feed clients are speculative.

When adding a format: parse into the same bank-line rows as CSV/XLSX; do not invent a second matching engine.
